WEBVTT

00:19.820 --> 00:24.158
The wound inside
my sealed memories

00:24.158 --> 00:28.862
When it silently touches the heart

00:28.862 --> 00:36.537
Tears of loneliness behind
the gentle smile

00:36.537 --> 00:41.342
I seek boundless strength

00:41.342 --> 00:52.119
I continue to run up with
what I believe in

00:52.119 --> 00:54.221
I want to protect

00:54.221 --> 00:56.557
I want to believe

00:56.557 --> 01:00.794
all the reasons for that smile

01:00.794 --> 01:05.132
The heat and the love

01:05.132 --> 01:09.436
I accept them all

01:09.436 --> 01:13.040
I won't let go of your hand again

01:13.040 --> 01:21.709
Aiming towards that light...

01:31.592 --> 01:35.221
Previously on Shonen Onmyouji...

01:35.996 --> 01:40.399
Princess Akiko, as a
precaution, please take this.

01:41.535 --> 01:45.232
- What is this?
- It's a protection charm.

01:45.672 --> 01:47.307
Excuse me...

01:47.307 --> 01:50.868
This is from Miss Akiko,
as a token of gratitude.

01:53.447 --> 01:57.117
She is a fitting sacrifice
for you, Master!

01:57.117 --> 01:59.711
We will go bring her
back for you!

02:01.522 --> 02:04.753
A Woman's Desires
Roped in from Beyond

02:11.265 --> 02:13.563
Miss Akiko.

02:15.903 --> 02:17.871
Miss Akiko.

02:20.641 --> 02:22.199
Who is it?

02:30.017 --> 02:31.985
What was that?

02:32.486 --> 02:34.388
Miss Akiko.

02:34.388 --> 02:37.157
- Who is it?
- Miss Akiko...

02:37.157 --> 02:40.060
Please come out here.

02:40.060 --> 02:42.830
Miss... Keiko?

02:42.830 --> 02:45.032
We haven't met in a while.

02:45.032 --> 02:49.236
I can't see you clearly
from here.

02:49.236 --> 02:52.262
Please, come out.

02:54.174 --> 02:56.039
Darn you.

03:02.449 --> 03:04.974
Princess! Princess!

03:07.187 --> 03:09.178
It's gone...

03:09.523 --> 03:13.360
Princess, is something wrong?
Is there an intruder?

03:13.360 --> 03:17.456
- No, it's nothing.
- But...

03:17.531 --> 03:20.134
I had wanted to see the sunrise,

03:20.134 --> 03:22.762
but I couldn't really see
where I was going.

03:24.771 --> 03:28.208
I knocked over the screen
by accident. It's nothing.

03:28.208 --> 03:32.079
Please don't tell Father.
I don't want him to tease me.

03:32.079 --> 03:33.637
All right...

03:34.348 --> 03:38.546
- You can leave if you want to.
- Please excuse us then.

03:53.767 --> 03:57.066
The charm Master Seimei
gave me is...

04:05.979 --> 04:08.849
Hey, Masahiro.

04:08.849 --> 04:12.085
The progress is slower
than I expected.

04:12.085 --> 04:15.956
I must restore Seiryou Quarters
to its former glory, but...

04:15.956 --> 04:19.393
Greetings, Lord Yukinari!
It's been a while.

04:19.393 --> 04:23.159
Oh, Yukinari!
How have you been?

04:24.231 --> 04:27.201
W-What are you doing,
Masahiro?!

04:27.201 --> 04:29.169
How are you?
Are you rather busy...

04:29.169 --> 04:31.705
now that the Kikou Festival
is approaching?

04:31.705 --> 04:34.007
Yes, I am. Though it's just
delivering letters...

04:34.007 --> 04:36.577
and searching for essential
things for the festival.

04:36.577 --> 04:38.579
Only miscellaneous jobs.

04:38.579 --> 04:41.515
Such things are still
important, you know.

04:41.515 --> 04:43.150
Thank you.

04:43.150 --> 04:44.117
By the way...

04:44.117 --> 04:44.651
That hurt.
By the way...

04:44.651 --> 04:45.586
That hurt.
The court officials have been
talking about a rumor recently.

04:45.586 --> 04:48.020
The court officials have been
talking about a rumor recently.

04:48.689 --> 04:51.558
Did you hear any rumors
at the onmyou dorms?

04:51.558 --> 04:54.328
No, I didn't hear anything.

04:54.328 --> 04:56.263
What kind of rumor is it?

04:56.263 --> 04:58.966
A demoness apparently
appears at Kifune nightly,

04:58.966 --> 05:00.934
and strikes a nail
with a hammer.

05:00.934 --> 05:02.869
A demoness at Kifune?

05:02.869 --> 05:05.005
She's trying to put a curse
on someone?

05:05.005 --> 05:08.308
Well, it may simply be
a harmless rumor.

05:08.308 --> 05:11.478
If nobody has heard about it
at the onmyou dorms,

05:11.478 --> 05:14.038
then we shouldn't
take it too seriously.

05:14.414 --> 05:17.406
Probably... Kifune...

05:19.620 --> 05:22.589
Grandfather abandoned me.

05:24.992 --> 05:26.960
The sound of a hammer?

05:28.161 --> 05:29.992
Grandfather!

05:30.497 --> 05:32.260
Masahiro?

05:32.799 --> 05:35.068
Are you unwell?
You look distracted.

05:35.068 --> 05:37.537
Seimei asked for you,
didn't he?

05:37.537 --> 05:40.574
I'm sorry, Lord Yukinari. I...

05:40.574 --> 05:44.611
Oh, I apologize for holding you
up when you're so busy.

05:44.611 --> 05:47.136
- Please, go ahead.
- Excuse me.

05:49.049 --> 05:51.984
- I understand.
- I'm counting on you.

05:53.420 --> 05:55.251
Grandfather!

05:56.256 --> 05:59.359
I'm here because you
asked for me.

05:59.359 --> 06:01.725
Oh, that's right.

06:02.329 --> 06:05.632
According to this letter,
East Third Palace...

06:05.632 --> 06:09.236
is currently experiencing
something frightening.

06:09.236 --> 06:11.371
The Minister of the Left's
house?

06:11.371 --> 06:13.106
Masahiro.

06:13.106 --> 06:16.371
- Be there on my behalf.
- Yes.

06:18.211 --> 06:20.042
This scent...

06:21.615 --> 06:25.312
Master Seimei sent Masahiro here
on his behalf as he's occupied?

06:26.987 --> 06:30.624
Princess! You shouldn't
show yourself so easily!

06:30.624 --> 06:33.960
Why must the blinds be
lowered all the time?

06:33.960 --> 06:35.929
It's a tradition.

06:35.929 --> 06:39.733
It irritates me that I can't
see the other person's face.

06:39.733 --> 06:43.904
W-Well, you can still have
a clear view through the blinds.

06:43.904 --> 06:46.634
- What?!
- Princess!

06:47.507 --> 06:49.372
It's fine!

06:50.010 --> 06:53.146
You mean I should talk to someone
with my view obstructed?

06:53.146 --> 06:55.615
W-Well, please calm
down, Akiko.

06:55.615 --> 06:57.517
You brazen fellow!
How dare you...

06:57.517 --> 06:59.678
call the Princess by
her first name!

07:00.253 --> 07:03.156
- I apologize!
- That's enough.

07:03.156 --> 07:05.425
I have something to
discuss with Masahiro.

07:05.425 --> 07:09.096
- Don't come in until I say so.
- Princess, that's not right.

07:09.096 --> 07:10.564
It's perfectly all right.

07:10.564 --> 07:15.035
My father trusts Masahiro
and he's a capable onmyouji.

07:15.035 --> 07:17.704
- It'll be fine.
- But...

07:17.704 --> 07:20.400
- Utsugi!
- Yes...

07:24.044 --> 07:26.947
Well, the letter my grandfather
received...

07:26.947 --> 07:29.649
was from you, isn't it?
What happened?

07:29.649 --> 07:32.486
There's an item
I want you to see.

07:32.486 --> 07:34.283
Please come with me.

07:36.156 --> 07:38.024
Have a look at this.

07:38.024 --> 07:39.960
A... talisman?

07:39.960 --> 07:42.062
No, it's a protection charm.

07:42.062 --> 07:44.464
It's a gift from Master Seimei.

07:44.464 --> 07:47.401
He said it could protect
me from harm.

07:47.401 --> 07:49.803
However, cracks have appeared,

07:49.803 --> 07:51.705
and it's cloudy and white now.

07:51.705 --> 07:53.673
The barrier is not as
strong as before too.

07:53.673 --> 07:57.077
This is an indication that
something unnatural was here.

07:57.077 --> 07:59.671
Have you encountered any
monster or demon recently?

08:01.148 --> 08:02.816
I have a distant relative...

08:02.816 --> 08:05.919
A princess by the name of
Fujiwara no Keiko.

08:05.919 --> 08:09.790
I saw Miss Keiko in the
garden before dawn,

08:09.790 --> 08:12.993
and something weird
was behind her.

08:12.993 --> 08:16.663
I couldn't see it clearly, but
it was black and ominous.

08:16.663 --> 08:20.066
It seemed like the ayakashi
from before.

08:20.066 --> 08:24.093
There was something very evil
and frightening about it.

08:24.538 --> 08:28.208
I wrote a letter to Miss Keiko
in the morning,

08:28.208 --> 08:31.478
and her mother sent
a reply to me.

08:31.478 --> 08:34.681
She said that Miss Keiko
had fallen ill.

08:34.681 --> 08:39.914
That's why I asked Father
if I could pay her a visit.

08:43.190 --> 08:46.626
The evil aura around her was so
strong that it was unbearable.

08:47.394 --> 08:49.296
Miss Keiko?

08:49.296 --> 08:51.465
Oh, Miss Akiko.

08:51.465 --> 08:53.667
You are here to see me.

08:53.667 --> 08:59.372
No matter what, you must go to
a place with me, Miss Akiko.

08:59.372 --> 09:01.340
Come, let's go together.

09:03.944 --> 09:07.781
- "Let's go?" To where?
- I don't know.

09:07.781 --> 09:11.351
But she would be coming
for me tonight.

09:11.351 --> 09:14.582
- Tonight?
- Yes, at two in the morning.

09:15.322 --> 09:18.325
You must help Miss Keiko,
Masahiro.

09:18.325 --> 09:20.827
An onmyouji can save
people, right?

09:20.827 --> 09:23.930
An onmyouji lends a hand to
those in trouble, right?

09:23.930 --> 09:27.067
I understand. Don't worry,
I'll go have a look.

09:27.067 --> 09:28.802
Thank you, Masahiro.

09:28.802 --> 09:31.738
And if I sense that
something is wrong,

09:31.738 --> 09:34.007
I'll stop by again later.

09:34.007 --> 09:35.842
What do you mean
by "later"?

09:35.842 --> 09:37.811
I'll come secretly
when it's dark.

09:37.811 --> 09:40.480
- Wow...
- If it's possible...

09:40.480 --> 09:45.018
I'd like you to write a note in
case the guards are suspicious.

09:45.018 --> 09:46.753
Please wait a moment.

09:46.753 --> 09:50.757
Well, I'll fix the barrier
in the meantime.

09:50.757 --> 09:52.926
Thank you, Masahiro.

09:52.926 --> 09:55.451
[chant]

09:56.396 --> 09:58.398
How is it, Mokkun?

09:58.398 --> 10:01.856
I think it can hold out
for now.

10:02.636 --> 10:07.107
Well, it'll be fine, but you still
have to fix the barrier later.

10:07.107 --> 10:10.076
We have nothing to fear
if she stays in here.

10:12.012 --> 10:15.846
Here, this note should grant you
access through the gates.

10:17.851 --> 10:19.819
Oh, that's right.

10:19.819 --> 10:22.689
Keep this with you. Scents
are able to resist evil.

10:22.689 --> 10:26.660
Oh... It's the sachet I
gave you the last time.

10:26.660 --> 10:28.595
I have always kept it
with me,

10:28.595 --> 10:31.097
so its effectiveness should
be intensified.

10:31.097 --> 10:32.966
Always?

10:32.966 --> 10:37.426
No, well... I meant...
I liked that scent...

10:38.471 --> 10:41.775
Y-You mixed it yourself,
didn't you, Akiko?

10:41.775 --> 10:45.211
- You're really good.
- Really? I'm glad you think so.

10:48.648 --> 10:51.351
I'll give this to you then.

10:51.351 --> 10:53.512
We'll exchange each
other's sachets.

11:00.293 --> 11:03.820
Hey... Masahiro...

11:04.731 --> 11:06.699
I should leave now.

11:07.167 --> 11:11.729
I must remind you.
Never leave this place at 2 am.

11:12.672 --> 11:13.366
Yes!

11:17.177 --> 11:19.579
Princess Fujiwara no
Keiko's residence...

11:19.579 --> 11:22.070
should be along this street.

11:25.085 --> 11:28.622
Kifune Mountain is
over there...

11:28.622 --> 11:31.458
Hey, didn't Lord Yukinari say
that a demoness...

11:31.458 --> 11:34.916
striking a nail with a hammer
is seen every night?

11:35.729 --> 11:39.532
I can't detect any abnormal
aura from here.

11:39.532 --> 11:42.936
Local officials and Shinto
priests are based in Kifune.

11:42.936 --> 11:45.672
So I'm sure they'll alert
the Imperial Court...

11:45.672 --> 11:47.435
if a demoness really appears.

11:51.778 --> 11:54.679
The street is empty!
When did they?!

11:56.783 --> 11:59.980
What? Mokkun, there!

12:01.988 --> 12:04.457
Are you going to intervene?

12:04.457 --> 12:07.949
You're... Princess Fujiwara
no Keiko.

12:08.328 --> 12:11.131
Do not meddle in this.

12:11.131 --> 12:14.434
You can't stop me.
Retreat now.

12:14.434 --> 12:16.836
And I'm willing to let this go.

12:16.836 --> 12:19.005
That shadow...

12:19.005 --> 12:21.041
Soldiers that confront,
men that fight...

12:21.041 --> 12:22.842
Stop it now!

12:22.842 --> 12:26.039
Fall into place and
go forth with might!

12:29.115 --> 12:31.049
Stay back, Masahiro!

12:33.186 --> 12:35.055
A foreign demon.

12:35.055 --> 12:37.888
That aura is unmistakable.

12:39.259 --> 12:42.990
Listen here. I'll not
let anyone ruin my plans.

12:48.134 --> 12:50.036
Are you all right, Masahiro?

12:50.036 --> 12:51.705
I was careless.

12:51.705 --> 12:54.641
I had not realized that
we entered a barrier.

12:54.641 --> 12:57.010
I didn't realize it either.

12:57.010 --> 12:59.911
Seimei will yell at us
when we return.

13:00.346 --> 13:04.715
We have to proceed to
Princess Keiko's residence now.

13:18.198 --> 13:20.900
This happened two weeks ago.

13:20.900 --> 13:23.203
The prince that she was
going to marry...

13:23.203 --> 13:27.037
changed his mind and married
another princess instead.

13:27.474 --> 13:30.076
My daughter was heartbroken...

13:30.076 --> 13:33.739
She gave up on life
and fell sick.

13:35.615 --> 13:38.175
We were originally a couple...

13:38.952 --> 13:42.581
But I can't really blame him...

13:42.956 --> 13:45.288
I heard that...

13:46.259 --> 13:48.394
A selfish princess
complained that...

13:48.394 --> 13:52.057
he was the only man
that she would marry.

13:53.133 --> 13:55.869
He could not reject her,

13:55.869 --> 13:59.464
since that princess came
from a noble family.

14:00.206 --> 14:02.609
I'm part of the Fujiwara clan.

14:02.609 --> 14:05.512
I don't belong to
the lower social class...

14:05.512 --> 14:07.847
But it's all right.

14:07.847 --> 14:09.906
It's all right...

14:10.683 --> 14:14.454
I think we should conduct
a ritual to rid her of evil.

14:14.454 --> 14:18.725
The princess will recover once
we eliminate the evil spirit.

14:18.725 --> 14:22.495
Please... Please save Keiko!

14:22.495 --> 14:26.522
It hurts seeing her
suffering like this.

14:31.638 --> 14:34.641
Oh, I see.

14:34.641 --> 14:38.444
She was crushed by the Prince's
betrayal and became sick.

14:38.444 --> 14:41.714
And the foreign demons
probably made use of that.

14:41.714 --> 14:43.477
Probably?

14:44.684 --> 14:46.986
It's pathetic to hear you
sound so uncertain.

14:46.986 --> 14:50.924
Have you no confidence in
your theories, Masahiro?

14:50.924 --> 14:53.293
No, I don't mean that...

14:53.293 --> 14:56.930
How do you think people
in need of help will feel,

14:56.930 --> 15:00.433
if the onmyouji they rely on
was so unsure?

15:00.433 --> 15:02.001
That's true...

15:02.001 --> 15:06.806
So my teachings were not useful,
just as I had expected?

15:06.806 --> 15:10.043
Although it's normal for me
to die suddenly at this age,

15:10.043 --> 15:11.945
as long as you remain
this way...

15:11.945 --> 15:13.580
Don't say that!

15:13.580 --> 15:16.983
I apologize for being weak
enough to use that word.

15:16.983 --> 15:19.953
But I'll definitely exorcise
the demons...

15:19.953 --> 15:22.522
that are possessing
Princess Keiko.

15:22.522 --> 15:24.319
Excuse me.

15:26.259 --> 15:29.996
Hey, Seimei. He'll go into
a frenzy in his room again.

15:29.996 --> 15:33.199
It's great that Masahiro
goes berserk sometimes.

15:33.199 --> 15:37.101
Or else his suppressed emotions
will erupt sooner or later.

15:39.138 --> 15:41.107
Regarding Princess Keiko...

15:41.107 --> 15:43.610
Masahiro performed
a ritual prayer for her.

15:43.610 --> 15:46.379
But the efficacy of the ritual...

15:46.379 --> 15:49.382
Her condition is worse
than we thought.

15:49.382 --> 15:54.053
Nothing is scarier, or more
depressing than a woman scorned.

15:54.053 --> 15:56.544
I'm entrusting Masahiro
to you, Guren.

15:57.957 --> 16:01.060
Just wait and see,
you old raccoon!

16:01.060 --> 16:05.121
I'll surely outshine you!
Very soon!

16:06.566 --> 16:08.227
All right!

16:15.808 --> 16:17.833
Oh?

16:18.344 --> 16:21.714
I'm taking it along as it has
the ability to resist evil.

16:21.714 --> 16:24.581
I didn't say anything...

16:29.589 --> 16:32.854
W-What?
What are you doing?!

16:33.459 --> 16:34.794
The scent of aloeswood?

16:34.794 --> 16:38.698
Aloeswood is precious since its
scent could resist evil beings.

16:38.698 --> 16:41.565
I'm giving you some.
Be thankful for that.

16:41.868 --> 16:44.170
Aloeswood is not the
only thing in it.

16:44.170 --> 16:47.206
- Is that so?
- You're pathetic.

16:47.206 --> 16:49.742
You should have been
able to realize that.

16:49.742 --> 16:51.733
Shut up.

17:06.292 --> 17:07.827
Akiko?

17:07.827 --> 17:10.163
Masahiro, what are you
doing there?

17:10.163 --> 17:13.566
That doesn't matter.
What are you doing here?

17:13.566 --> 17:15.969
Walking around on your own?

17:15.969 --> 17:18.137
If you run into bandits,
nobody could save you!

17:18.137 --> 17:21.607
But I was worried
about Miss Keiko.

17:21.607 --> 17:26.704
And I know that you'd be going to
Miss Keiko's residence tonight...

17:28.548 --> 17:30.209
I'm sorry.

17:31.084 --> 17:34.287
You should go back
right now, Akiko.

17:34.287 --> 17:36.789
No! Take me along, please.

17:36.789 --> 17:38.391
- No!
- But...

17:38.391 --> 17:39.959
No means no!

17:39.959 --> 17:42.829
Akiko, you can only
see ayakashi, right?

17:42.829 --> 17:45.898
You won't be able to protect
yourself from attacks.

17:45.898 --> 17:47.627
Am I right?

17:48.201 --> 17:50.703
Can't you understand that?

17:50.703 --> 17:53.365
If you come along,
you'll just be...

17:55.608 --> 17:59.312
- What are you doing?
- Masahiro, you are too harsh.

17:59.312 --> 18:02.048
Akiko feels guilty already.

18:02.048 --> 18:03.516
Stop it already.

18:03.516 --> 18:07.887
It's almost time for
Princess Keiko to come for Akiko.

18:07.887 --> 18:10.412
You'd better send her
home soon.

18:11.657 --> 18:13.454
Let's go, Akiko.

18:15.361 --> 18:18.228
I'm very sorry, Masahiro.

18:24.470 --> 18:26.597
I apologize too...

18:28.174 --> 18:29.698
An evil aura!

18:32.278 --> 18:33.802
This is...

18:37.016 --> 18:39.786
- Miss Keiko?
- My, my, Miss Akiko...

18:39.786 --> 18:41.821
You came a long way.

18:41.821 --> 18:46.626
I'd have come to get you, but
you seem to be quite anxious.

18:46.626 --> 18:48.161
So you're the priest?

18:48.161 --> 18:52.465
Gaku, look at this kid.
He's just a greenhorn.

18:52.465 --> 18:55.368
I can see that, Shun.

18:55.368 --> 18:57.270
It's ridiculous that
a mere kid...

18:57.270 --> 18:59.705
should be permitted to
battle our master.

18:59.705 --> 19:02.542
Now, kid.
Give that girl to us.

19:02.542 --> 19:06.779
You heard him, kid. We may
spare your life if you obey us.

19:06.779 --> 19:10.516
Give us that girl so that we can
offer her to our master!

19:10.516 --> 19:13.753
That's right, Miss Akiko.
Come here.

19:13.753 --> 19:16.556
Princess Keiko!
They're deceiving you!

19:16.556 --> 19:20.393
My wish will be granted
if I give Miss Akiko to them.

19:20.393 --> 19:24.163
- All will be fine after tonight.
- Get lost!

19:24.163 --> 19:29.658
[chant]

19:33.906 --> 19:36.042
- Masahiro?
- I'm all right.

19:36.042 --> 19:38.840
Don't worry, I'll protect you.

19:39.879 --> 19:42.370
You little brat!

19:46.052 --> 19:47.720
Guren!

19:47.720 --> 19:50.280
- Guren is?
- He can handle it.

19:51.324 --> 19:56.062
Scoundrel, you're the deity
serving that priest. An ayakashi.

19:56.062 --> 19:59.031
This is your true form,
isn't it?

19:59.699 --> 20:01.801
I'm your opponent!

20:01.801 --> 20:03.860
You can't use the same
trick twice!

20:04.604 --> 20:07.402
- Guren!
- I won't allow you!

20:07.773 --> 20:09.775
Ten thousand demons, enfold!

20:09.775 --> 20:11.477
You...

20:11.477 --> 20:15.573
Masahiro has always been
battling such monsters?

20:18.518 --> 20:20.453
Miss... Keiko...

20:20.453 --> 20:23.890
Let's go together,
Miss Akiko.

20:23.890 --> 20:28.961
If you come with me,
they will grant my wish.

20:28.961 --> 20:31.297
Your... wish?

20:31.297 --> 20:32.787
Akiko!

20:34.033 --> 20:35.557
Masahiro!

20:39.772 --> 20:41.706
Release Akiko!

20:42.308 --> 20:44.877
You're just a stupid kid.

20:44.877 --> 20:47.710
I'll take your life
right here and now.

20:48.114 --> 20:49.849
That insolent look in
your eyes...

20:49.849 --> 20:52.579
I'll dig those eyes out
right now!

20:52.985 --> 20:54.680
You brat...

20:55.688 --> 20:57.451
The power of the perfume?

20:58.391 --> 21:00.291
Let's go, Keiko.

21:02.094 --> 21:05.029
- Wait!
- Masahiro!

21:16.275 --> 21:17.765
Akiko...

21:17.810 --> 21:21.541
Where are you, Akiko?
It's impossible...

21:21.814 --> 21:24.217
I promised to protect her...

21:24.217 --> 21:25.751
It's impossible.

21:25.751 --> 21:28.413
Akiko!

21:42.735 --> 21:54.213
I heard your voice inside
the deep darkness

21:54.213 --> 22:05.658
Just your phrase "I believe"
echoed in my heart

22:05.658 --> 22:11.430
You always stayed by my side

22:11.430 --> 22:16.766
You always gave me courage

22:19.238 --> 22:29.682
In order to continue
protecting our future

22:29.682 --> 22:36.389
I promise you, my beloved

22:36.389 --> 22:41.627
I won't give up

22:41.627 --> 22:47.366
I will keep overcoming my limits

22:47.366 --> 22:53.896
Surely surely surely

22:59.812 --> 23:02.542
Next Episode

23:23.436 --> 23:25.137
Next on Shonen Onmyouji...

23:25.137 --> 23:26.839
Episode 8.

23:26.839 --> 23:26.939
Stop the Resentment that
Echoes through Kifune.

23:26.939 --> 23:29.169
Episode 8
Stop the Resentment that
Echoes through Kifune
Stop the Resentment that
Echoes through Kifune.
